# The Flask app for /creator/ lives here, inside the document root.
# Passenger reads these files off the filesystem, so blocking HTTP access
# does not affect the running app. This keeps app.py, logs, templates and
# the rest of the source from being downloadable.
#
# Static assets are NOT served from here -- Flask serves them through the
# /creator mount, so this rule does not affect /creator/static/assets/*.
Require all denied
